{
  "source": "nodejs-sdk@c0ff3fd packages/core/src/http/media-type.test.ts and the case table of tests/Dexpace.Sdk.Core.Tests/Http/Common/MediaTypeTests.cs (the plan pins 54aeed4, which is not in the local clone; ruby-sdk@90075b1 carries docs only)",
  "note": "op=parse: Parse(input) gives type/subtype/parameters. op=reject: Parse(input) throws ArgumentException and TryParse returns false. op=roundtrip: Of(type, subtype, parameters) survives Parse(ToString()).",
